              "common:UUID": "eec0e09b-6fd5-41c9-9a12-41300c9e6cfa",
              "common:generalComment": [
                {
                  "#text": "This 2022 China 1-35-kV consumption-boundary result is the deterministic projection of Lifecycle Model eec0e09b@01.01.014. The model contains one factor-1 node, the exact published 21084c23@01.01.013 resulting Process, and carries its exchanges forward without rescaling.",
                  "@xml:lang": "en"
                },
                {
                  "#text": "本结果Process代表2022年中国1–35千伏消费边界，是Lifecycle Model eec0e09b@01.01.014的确定性投影。模型仅含一个系数为1的节点，即精确公开的21084c23@01.01.013结果Process，并原尺度传递其exchange。",
                  "@xml:lang": "zh"
                },
                {
                  "#text": "The resulting Process retains the established official 1-35 kV consumption-mix reference Flow at 3.6 MJ and the three source-documented operational emission exchanges projected by 21084c23@01.01.013.",
                  "@xml:lang": "en"
                },
                {
                  "#text": "结果Process保留既有正式1–35千伏消费组合参考Flow（3.6 MJ），以及21084c23@01.01.013投影的三项具有来源记录的运行期排放exchange。",
                  "@xml:lang": "zh"
                },
                {
                  "#text": "The inherited operational inventory uses China Electricity Council 2022 national generation, fossil CO2, SO2 and NOx totals. The 4.82% national all-voltage loss rate converts generation totals to the consumption-boundary delivered-electricity basis once upstream. The Partly terminated system boundary ends before generation technology, upstream fuels, grid infrastructure, dust pending particle-size allocation, and other pollutants.",
                  "@xml:lang": "en"
                },
                {
                  "#text": "继承的运行期清单采用中国电力企业联合会2022年全国发电量及化石源CO₂、SO₂、NOₓ总量。全国全电压等级线损率4.82%仅在上游用于将发电总量换算为消费边界的交付电量基准。部分终止系统边界止于发电技术、上游燃料、电网基础设施、尚待粒径分配的烟尘和其他污染物之前。",
                  "@xml:lang": "zh"
                }
              ],
