              "dataCutOffAndCompletenessPrinciples": [
                {
                  "#text": "Coverage comprises 1-35 kV reference electricity and source-documented operational fossil CO2, SO2 and NOx. The Partly terminated system boundary ends before generation-technology composition, upstream fuel supply, generation and grid infrastructure, construction, maintenance, end-of-life, water, CH4, N2O, aggregate dust pending particle-size allocation, and other pollutants.",
                  "@xml:lang": "en"
                },
                {
                  "#text": "覆盖范围包括1–35千伏参考电力以及具有来源记录的运行期化石源CO₂、SO₂和NOₓ。部分终止系统边界止于发电技术构成、上游燃料供应、发电及电网基础设施、建设、维护、报废、用水、CH₄、N₂O、尚待粒径分配的烟尘和其他污染物之前。",
                  "@xml:lang": "zh"
                }
              ],
              "dataTreatmentAndExtrapolationsPrinciples": [
                {
                  "#text": "Inventory quantities are calculated from China Electricity Council 2022 sector totals. Standard elementary-flow identities characterize the calculated Chinese operational emissions. The national all-voltage loss rate converts generation totals to the consumption-boundary delivered-electricity basis and is applied once upstream.",
                  "@xml:lang": "en"
                },
                {
                  "#text": "清单数量根据中国电力企业联合会2022年行业总量计算。标准基本流用于表征计算所得的中国运行期排放。全国全电压等级线损率用于将发电总量换算为消费边界的交付电量基准，并仅在上游应用一次。",
                  "@xml:lang": "zh"
